      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "When re-instancing a component, we have to make sure all instance owners'\nconstruction scripts are re-ran (in-case modifying the component alters\nthe construction of the actor).\n@param  ComponentClass    Identifies the component that was altered (used to find all its instances, and thusly all instance owners)."
    },
